{"hsID": "121173351584", "pin": "54315", "category": "Exhibitor", "confirmed": "1", "optin_delegate": "1", "reference": "14899", "aboutMe": "I’m Roland Siebert, Founder & CEO of SLACE. I work with retailers and consumer brands on a simple question: how can we turn everyday POS, checkout and promotion moments into direct, measurable shopper relationships?

