If you are exploring ways to make promotions more engaging, measurable and integrated into the retail tech stack, I’d be happy to exchange ideas and show what we are building together with GK Software.", "updated": "2026-06-03 04:12:53"}

{"hsID": "18033093469", "pin": "56375", "category": "Delegate (Industry Partner)", "confirmed": "1", "optin_delegate": "1", "reference": "14575", "aboutMe": "APAC doesn’t wait for anyone, and neither should your commerce platform. I’m Sophie, Enterprise Account Executive at commercetools, and I help retailers across the region break free from legacy tech that’s costing them speed, revenue, and customer loyalty. commercetools is the pioneer of modern, composable commerce technology: a modular, AI-ready, and built for markets that move at their own pace. 

