{"hsID": "2172522", "pin": "43021", "category": "Delegate (Retailer)", "confirmed": "1", "optin_delegate": "1", "reference": "11957", "aboutMe": "I lead Marketing and CRM for Eu Yan Sang Singapore, overseeing brand strategy, retail marketing, e-commerce, CRM and loyalty, digital transformation, communications, customer experience, and strategic partnerships.

