{"hsID": "73825682535", "pin": "42486", "category": "Exhibitor", "confirmed": "1", "optin_delegate": "1", "reference": "14586", "aboutMe": "A seasoned commercial leader in the information and communications technology (ICT) industry, Kara currently serves as Country Head for Singapore and Malaysia at Glory Global Solutions. With 20 years of experience spanning service, product, and solution sales, she has built and led high-performing teams across Southeast Asia, driving sustainable growth and operational excellence.

Kara's professional journey has seen her take on various senior regional sales leadership roles, where she partnered with banking, government, and enterprise clients to deliver customised technology solutions that enhanced productivity and streamlined processes. A graduate of Nanyang Technological University, Kara holds a Bachelor of Marketing and brings both frontline commercial expertise and strategic oversight shaped by years of cross-cultural collaboration.
", "updated": "2026-06-03 04:12:53"}

{"hsID": "221735989323", "pin": "71399", "category": "Delegate (Industry Partner)", "confirmed": "1", "optin_delegate": "1", "reference": "14018", "aboutMe": "Rodger is the Vice President – Sales, APAC at Syndigo, a leading provider of data and content solutions that help organisations deliver consistent, high-quality product experiences across all channels.

With over 25 years of experience in enterprise technology, Rodger has held a range of roles spanning technical consulting, sales, and leadership across organisations such as CA, Oracle, Information Builders, Talend, and Akeneo. Throughout his career, he has focused on helping businesses across ANZ and APAC leverage data management, business intelligence, and analytics to drive growth and support downstream applications.

Rodger brings a strong commercial and technical perspective, enabling organisations to unlock value through better data, improved product content, and more effective digital experiences.", "updated": "2026-06-03 04:12:53"}
